sequenceDiagram
    participant UserBrowser
    participant BackendServer

    Note right of UserBrowser: User types a note and clicks submit

    UserBrowser->>BackendServer: POST /new_note (with note data)
    activate BackendServer
    BackendServer-->>UserBrowser: HTTP 302 Redirect to /notes
    deactivate BackendServer

    Note right of UserBrowser: Browser automatically follows redirect

    UserBrowser->>BackendServer: GET /notes
    BackendServer-->>UserBrowser: HTML page

    UserBrowser->>BackendServer: GET /main.css
    BackendServer-->>UserBrowser: CSS file

    UserBrowser->>BackendServer: GET /main.js
    BackendServer-->>UserBrowser: JavaScript file

    Note right of UserBrowser: JS runs and fetches notes

    UserBrowser->>BackendServer: GET /data.json
    BackendServer-->>UserBrowser: Updated note list

    Note right of UserBrowser: JS displays all notes including the new one
